    "body": "## Motivation\n\n`POST /start_profile` with `profile_by_stage: true` and no `num_steps` left the stage counters as `None`. The next prefill did `None += 1` and killed every scheduler. Fixes #47294.\n\n## Modifications\n\nStage counters start at 0 whenever `profile_by_stage` is set. A missing `num_steps` no longer auto-stops the profile; `/stop_profile` still ends it.\n\n## Accuracy Tests\n\nNo model-output change. Not applicable.\n\n## Speed Tests and Profiling\n\nNo inference-speed change. Not applicable.\n\n## Checklist\n\n- [ ] Format your code according to the [Format code with pre-commit](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#format-code-with-pre-commit).\n- [x] Add unit tests according to the [Run and add unit tests](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#run-and-add-unit-tests).\n- [ ] Update documentation according to [Write documentations](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#write-documentations).\n- [ ] Provide accuracy and speed benchmark results according to [Test the accuracy](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#test-the-accuracy) and [Benchmark the speed](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#benchmark-the-speed).\n- [x] Follow the SGLang code style [guidance](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#code-style-guidance).\n\nLocal check: `pytest test/registered/unit/managers/test_profile_by_stage_without_steps.py -q` — passed. The test is registered on `base-a-test-cpu` and uses `CustomTestCase`.\n\n## Review and Merge Process\n\n1. Ping Merge Oncalls to start the process. See the [PR Merge Process](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/main/.github/MAINTAINER.md#pull-request-merge-process).\n2. Get approvals from [CODEOWNERS](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/blob/main/.github/CODEOWNERS) and other reviewers.\n3. Trigger CI tests with [comments](https://docs.sglang.io/developer_guide/contribution_guide.html#how-to-trigger-ci-tests) or contact authorized users to do so.\n   - Common commands include `/tag-and-rerun-ci`, `/tag-run-ci-label`, `/rerun-failed-ci`\n4. After green CI and required approvals, ask Merge Oncalls or people with Write permission to merge the PR.\n\n<!-- pr-states:start -->\n---\n### CI States\n\nLatest PR Test (Base): <!-- slot:pr-test:start -->:x: [Run #41101850423](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41101850423)<!-- slot:pr-test:end -->\nLatest PR Test (Extra): <!-- slot:pr-test-extra:start -->:x: [Run #41101850302](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41101850302)<!-- slot:pr-test-extra:end -->\nLatest PR Test (AMD ROCm 10): <!-- slot:pr-test-amd:start -->:x: [Run #41101850421](https://github.com/sgl-project/sglang/actions/runs/41101850421)<!-- slot:pr-test-amd:end -->\n<!-- pr-states:end -->",
